/Tue/Wed)","cat":"pve","banner":"CR_MONTUESWED.webp"},{"tip":"Advent Expedition: Yeonhee","cat":"pve","banner":"ADVENT_YH.webp"}],"lore":"Sera is a mage currently working for the Shadow Clan.\nShe's actually in her mid-to-late 20s but now appears younger because she was in a freak accident where she was struck by lightning during a magic experiment.\nOr so her cover story goes. She had actually been attempting to cast a legendary death-defying spell, but failed and was turned into a child as a side-effect.\nAs a result, she is now a foul-mouthed, ill-tempered, black-magic-slinging little witch.\nHer powers seem to have shrunk alongside her body, and she constantly complains about being stronger \"back in the day.\"\nShe's close friends with Ballista, a colleague of hers from the Shadow Clan.\nShe's starting to become a little irritated by Ballista's constant doting, though. \"But you look so cute, I can't help it!\" Ballista often remarks in response to these complaints.\nShe is trying her best to return her body to normal but hasn't made much progress.\nWhile she is a black magician with a penchant for conducting forbidden experiments, she doesn't form obsessions on the same level as someone like Mercure."}